              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeroo sana ilmi akka fedhii fooniitti dhalate sun ilma humna Hafuuraatiin dhalate ariʼate. Amma illee akkasuma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
